    `,isPhishing:!1,difficulty:"beginner",redFlags:[],explanation:"This is a legitimate internal email about school operations. The sender uses the correct organizational domain, the content is specific and relates to normal school activities, there is no urgency or pressure, and no sensitive information or actions are requested.",receivedTime:"2 hours ago"},{id:"11",subject:"Invoice #INV-2024-8847 - Classroom Supplies - Payment Overdue",senderName:"Staples Business Advantage",senderEmail:"accounts@staples-business-invoicing.com",bodyHtml:`
